  },
  "culinary_uncompromisingness": {
    "score": 12,
    "analysis": "The food is highly compromised and westernized to suit conservative high-street palates, relying on heavily sweetened tomato sauces, excess cream, and pre-packaged cheeses. Uncompromising, authentic elements like bitter greens, offal, true handmade al dente pasta, or regional cured meats are absent."
