  "establishment_integrity": {
    "score": 80,
    "analysis": "The venue structurally passes the basic criteria of a sit-down establishment, offering full table service, wine lists, reservations, and a traditional dining setup. However, it functions fundamentally as a commercialized food assembly line lacking any independent culinary soul."
